    "title": "2 Shreveport men arrested for domestic violence - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Gabrielle Parish ,\n6 hours ago SHREVEPORT, La. — Shreveport police say domestic violence cases are piling up. The department is handling its third major case just this week alone. The latest happened Tuesday when police said Timothy Young held down a woman and choked her inside the Ashton Pines Apartments -- until her teenage son heard her screams. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
